        "#@title **🏗 Setup Cell** {\"display-mode\":\"form\", \"form-width\":\"25%\"}\n",
        "#@markdown **Run this to import libraries and download data!**\n",
        "\n",
        "#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# IMPORTS\n",
